COMPILATION OF: E46N10

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E46N10

   1 a 0000 E46N10:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-42/P2c] FILE PAGE.  COPYLPT:53 is 0215-0226 =
   4 a 0006      attach, CALL ?PAGOP, CALL ?QIOOP, 18 bytes, behind a
   5 a 0006      PRINT open.  ?PAGOP has never appeared in an object
   6 a 0006      of mine on EITHER route.  P2c's perimeter says keep
   7 a 0006      PAGE refused, so this probe records DR's verdict and
   8 a 0006      the byte cost without claiming it. */
   9 c 0006   dcl outf file;
  10 c 0006   open file(outf) stream output title('N10OUT DAT');
  11 c 0023   put file(outf) page;
  12 c 0035   close file(outf);
  13 a 003B end E46N10;

CODE SIZE = 003E
DATA AREA = 000A
FREE SYMS = 38B0
END  COMPILATION
